                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0153.mp3"
                },
                {
                    "en": "I appreciate your feedback",
                    "es": "Aprecio tus comentarios",
                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0154.mp3"
                },
                {
                    "en": "In my opinion, that's fair",
                    "es": "En mi opinión, es justo",
                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0155.mp3"
                },
                {
                    "en": "Do you have a suggestion?",
                    "es": "¿Tienes alguna sugerencia?",
                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0156.mp3"
                },
                {
                    "en": "Let's keep the tone polite",
                    "es": "Mantengamos el tono educado",
                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0157.mp3"
                },
                {
                    "en": "May I clarify that point?",
                    "es": "¿Puedo aclarar ese punto?",
                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0158.mp3"
                },
                {
                    "en": "I'll follow up tomorrow",
                    "es": "Haré un seguimiento mañana",
                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0159.mp3"
                },
                {
                    "en": "Thanks for the update, I'll get back to you soon",
                    "es": "Gracias por la actualización, te responderé pronto",
                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0160.mp3"
                },
                {
                    "en": "Let's agree on the next steps together",
                    "es": "Acordemos los próximos pasos juntos",
                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0161.mp3"
                },
                {
                    "en": "Please keep me posted if anything changes",
                    "es": "Por favor, mantenme informado si algo cambia",
                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0162.mp3"
                },
                {
                    "en": "Feel free to reach out anytime",
                    "es": "No dudes en contactarme en cualquier momento",
                    "audio": "https://storage.googleapis.com/costam-3f612.firebasestorage.app/audio/es/01/es_0163.mp3"
